msgstr "例如：浏览器扩展、移动应用"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/create_api_token_modal.html:22
#: bookmarks/views/settings.py:213
msgid "API Token"
msgstr "API 令牌"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/create_api_token_modal.html:24
msgid "A descriptive name to identify the purpose of the token"
msgstr "用于标识令牌用途的描述性名称"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/create_api_token_modal.html:29
msgid "Create Token"
msgstr "创建令牌"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:4
msgid "Settings - Linkding"
msgstr "设置 - Linkding"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:9
#: bookmarks/templates/shared/nav_menu.html:32
#: bookmarks/templates/shared/nav_menu.html:95
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:14
msgid "Profile"
msgstr "个人资料"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:16
msgid "Change password"
msgstr "更改密码"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:24
msgid "Language"
msgstr "语言"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:28
msgid ""
"The language of the user interface. Choose Auto to use the language of your "
"browser."
msgstr "界面语言。选择“自动”以使用浏览器的语言。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:32
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "主题"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:36
msgid ""
"Whether to use a light or dark theme, or automatically adjust the theme "
"based on your system's settings."
msgstr "使用浅色或深色主题，或根据系统设置自动调整主题。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:40
msgid "Bookmark date format"
msgstr "书签日期格式"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:44
msgid ""
"Whether to show bookmark dates as relative (how long ago), or as absolute "
"dates. Alternatively the date can be hidden."
msgstr "书签日期显示为相对时间（多久以前）还是绝对日期。也可以隐藏日期。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:48
msgid "Bookmark description"
msgstr "书签描述"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:52
msgid ""
"Whether to show bookmark descriptions and tags in the same line, or as "
"separate blocks."
msgstr "书签描述和标签显示在同一行，还是作为单独的块。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:56
msgid "Bookmark description max lines"
msgstr "书签描述最大行数"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:60
msgid ""
"Limits the number of lines that are displayed for the bookmark description."
msgstr "限制书签描述显示的最大行数。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:64
msgid "Show bookmark URL"
msgstr "显示书签 URL"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:67
msgid "When enabled, this setting displays the bookmark URL below the title."
msgstr "启用后，此设置会在标题下方显示书签 URL。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:71
msgid "Show notes permanently"
msgstr "永久显示备注"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:74
msgid ""
"Whether to show bookmark notes permanently, without having to toggle them "
"individually. Alternatively the keyboard shortcut <code>e</code> can be used "
"to temporarily show all notes."
msgstr "是否永久显示书签备注，而无需逐个切换。也可以使用键盘快捷键 <code>e</code> 临时显示所有备注。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:81
msgid "Bookmark actions"
msgstr "书签操作"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:90
msgid "Which actions to display for each bookmark."
msgstr "每个书签显示哪些操作。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:93
msgid "Open bookmarks in"
msgstr "打开书签的方式"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:97
msgid "Whether to open bookmarks a new page or in the same page."
msgstr "在新页面还是同一页面打开书签。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:101
msgid "Items per page"
msgstr "每页项目数"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:106
msgid "The number of bookmarks to display per page."
msgstr "每页显示的书签数量。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:110
msgid "Sticky pagination"
msgstr "固定分页"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:113
msgid ""
"When enabled, the pagination controls will stick to the bottom of the "
"screen, so that they are always visible without having to scroll to the end "
"of the page first."
msgstr "启用后，分页控件将固定在屏幕底部，因此无需先滚动到页面末尾即可始终可见。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:117
msgid "Collapse side panel"
msgstr "折叠侧边栏"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:120
msgid ""
"When enabled, the tags side panel will be collapsed by default to give more "
"space to the bookmark list. Instead, the tags are shown in an expandable "
"drawer."
msgstr "启用后，标签侧边栏默认折叠，以便为书签列表留出更多空间。标签将在可展开的抽屉中显示。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:124
msgid "Hide bundles"
msgstr "隐藏书签集"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:127
msgid ""
"Allows to hide the bundles in the side panel if you don't intend to use them."
msgstr "如果你不打算使用书签集，可以在侧边栏中隐藏它们。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:131
msgid "Tag search"
msgstr "标签搜索"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:135
msgid ""
"In strict mode, tags must be prefixed with a hash character (#). In lax "
"mode, tags can also be searched without the hash character. Note that tags "
"without the hash character are indistinguishable from search terms, which "
"means the search result will also include bookmarks where a search term "
"matches otherwise."
msgstr "在严格模式下，标签必须带有井号（#）前缀。在宽松模式下，也可以不带井号搜索标签。请注意，不带井号的标签与搜索词无法区分，这意味着搜索结果也会包含搜索词匹配的其他书签。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:139
msgid "Enable legacy search"
msgstr "启用旧版搜索"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:142
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Since version 1.44.0, linkding has a new search engine that supports logical "
"expressions (and, or, not). If you run into any issues with the new search, "
"you can enable this option to temporarily switch back to the old search. "
"Please report any issues you encounter with the new search on <a "
"href=\"%(issues_url)s\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a> so they can be "
"addressed. This option will be removed in a future version."
msgstr "自 1.44.0 版本起，linkding 拥有一个支持逻辑表达式（and、or、not）的新搜索引擎。如果你在使用新搜索时遇到任何问题，可以启用此选项暂时切换回旧搜索。请在 <a href=\"%(issues_url)s\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a> 上报告你遇到的任何问题，以便得到解决。此选项将在未来版本中移除。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:151
msgid "Tag grouping"
msgstr "标签分组"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:155
msgid ""
"In alphabetical mode, tags will be grouped by the first letter. If disabled, "
"tags will not be grouped."
msgstr "在按字母模式下，标签将按首字母分组。禁用后，标签将不分组。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:161
#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:164
msgid "Auto Tagging"
msgstr "自动标签"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:168
msgid ""
"Automatically adds tags to bookmarks based on predefined rules. Each line is "
"a single rule that maps a URL to one or more tags. For example: "
"<pre>youtube.com video reddit.com/r/Music music reddit</pre>"
msgstr "根据预定义规则自动为书签添加标签。每一行是一条规则，将 URL 映射到一个或多个标签。例如：<pre>youtube.com video reddit.com/r/Music music reddit</pre>"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:177
msgid "Enable Favicons"
msgstr "启用网站图标"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:180
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Automatically loads favicons for bookmarked websites and displays them next "
"to each bookmark. Enabling this feature automatically downloads all missing "
"favicons. By default, this feature uses a <b>Google service</b> to download "
"favicons. If you don't want to use this service, check the <a "
"href=\"%(provider_url)s\" target=\"_blank\">options documentation</a> on how "
"to configure a custom favicon provider. Icons are downloaded in the "
"background, and it may take a while for them to show up."
msgstr "自动加载已收藏网站的网站图标，并在每个书签旁显示。启用此功能会自动下载所有缺失的网站图标。默认情况下，此功能使用 <b>Google 服务</b>下载网站图标。如果你不想使用此服务，请查看<a href=\"%(provider_url)s\" target=\"_blank\">选项文档</a>了解如何配置自定义网站图标提供程序。图标在后台下载，可能需要一段时间才能显示。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:190
msgid "Refresh Favicons"
msgstr "刷新网站图标"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:194
msgid "Enable Preview Images"
msgstr "启用预览图片"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:197
msgid ""
"Automatically loads preview images for bookmarked websites and displays them "
"next to each bookmark. Enabling this feature automatically downloads all "
"missing preview images."
msgstr "自动加载已收藏网站的预览图片，并在每个书签旁显示。启用此功能会自动下载所有缺失的预览图片。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:201
msgid "Internet Archive integration"
msgstr "Internet Archive 集成"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:205
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Enabling this feature will automatically create snapshots of bookmarked "
"websites on the <a href=\"%(archive_url)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Internet Archive Wayback Machine</a>. This allows to "
"preserve, and later access the website as it was at the point in time it was "
"bookmarked, in case it goes offline or its content is modified. Please "
"consider donating to the <a href=\"%(donate_url)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Internet Archive</a> if you make use of this feature."
msgstr "启用此功能将自动在 <a href=\"%(archive_url)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Internet Archive Wayback Machine</a> 上为已收藏网站创建快照。这样可以在网站离线或内容被修改时保留并稍后访问收藏时的网站状态。如果你使用此功能，请考虑向 <a href=\"%(donate_url)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Internet Archive</a> 捐款。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:215
msgid "Enable bookmark sharing"
msgstr "启用书签分享"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:218
msgid ""
"Allows to share bookmarks with other users, and to view shared bookmarks. "
"Disabling this feature will hide all previously shared bookmarks from other "
"users."
msgstr "允许与其他用户分享书签并查看共享书签。禁用此功能将向其他用户隐藏所有以前分享的书签。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:222
msgid "Enable public bookmark sharing"
msgstr "启用公开书签分享"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:226
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Makes shared bookmarks publicly accessible, without requiring a login. That "
"means that anyone with a link to this instance can view shared bookmarks via "
"the <a href=\"%(shared_url)s\">shared bookmarks page</a>."
msgstr "使共享书签无需登录即可公开访问。这意味着任何拥有此实例链接的人都可以通过<a href=\"%(shared_url)s\">共享书签页面</a>查看共享书签。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:234
msgid "Automatically create HTML snapshots"
msgstr "自动创建 HTML 快照"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:237
msgid ""
"Automatically creates HTML snapshots when adding bookmarks. Alternatively, "
"when disabled, snapshots can be created manually in the details view of a "
"bookmark."
msgstr "添加书签时自动创建 HTML 快照。或者，禁用后可以在书签详情视图中手动创建快照。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:239
msgid "Create missing HTML snapshots"
msgstr "创建缺失的 HTML 快照"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:243
msgid "Create bookmarks as unread by default"
msgstr "默认将书签创建为未读"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:246
msgid ""
"Sets the default state for the \"Mark as unread\" option when creating a new "
"bookmark. Setting this option will make all new bookmarks default to unread. "
"This can be overridden when creating each new bookmark."
msgstr "设置创建新书签时“标记为未读”选项的默认状态。启用此选项将使所有新书签默认为未读。创建每个新书签时可以覆盖此设置。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:254
msgid "Create bookmarks as shared by default"
msgstr "默认将书签创建为分享"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:257
msgid ""
"Sets the default state for the \"Share\" option when creating a new "
"bookmark. Setting this option will make all new bookmarks default to shared. "
"This can be overridden when creating each new bookmark."
msgstr "设置创建新书签时“分享”选项的默认状态。启用此选项将使所有新书签默认为分享状态。创建每个新书签时可以覆盖此设置。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:267
#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:269
msgid "Custom CSS"
msgstr "自定义 CSS"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:273
msgid "Allows to add custom CSS to the page."
msgstr "允许向页面添加自定义 CSS。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:287
msgid "Global settings"
msgstr "全局设置"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:294
msgid "Landing page"
msgstr "落地页"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:298
msgid ""
"The page that unauthenticated users are redirected to when accessing the "
"root URL."
msgstr "未登录用户访问根 URL 时重定向到的页面。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:302
msgid "Guest user profile"
msgstr "访客用户配置"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:306
msgid ""
"The user profile to use for users that are not logged in. This will affect "
"how publicly shared bookmarks are displayed regarding theme, bookmark list "
"settings, etc. You can either use your own profile or create a dedicated "
"user for this purpose. By default, a standard profile with fixed settings is "
"used."
msgstr "用于未登录用户的用户配置。这将影响公开共享书签的显示方式，包括主题、书签列表设置等。你可以使用自己的配置，或为此目的创建一个专用用户。默认情况下，使用具有固定设置的标准配置。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:310
msgid "Enable prefetching links on hover"
msgstr "悬停时预取链接"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:313
msgid ""
"Prefetches internal links when hovering over them. This can improve the "
"perceived performance when navigating application, but also increases the "
"load on the server as well as bandwidth usage."
msgstr "悬停时预取内部链接。这可以改善浏览应用时的感知性能，但也会增加服务器负载和带宽使用。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:327
msgid "Import"
msgstr "导入"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:329
msgid ""
"Import bookmarks and tags in the Netscape HTML format. This will execute a "
"sync where new bookmarks are added and existing ones are updated."
msgstr "以 Netscape HTML 格式导入书签和标签。这将执行一次同步，添加新书签并更新现有书签。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:341
msgid "Import public bookmarks as shared"
msgstr "将公开书签导入为共享"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:344
msgid ""
"When importing bookmarks from a service that supports marking bookmarks as "
"public or private (using the <code>PRIVATE</code> attribute), enabling this "
"option will import all bookmarks that are marked as not private as shared "
"bookmarks. Otherwise, all bookmarks will be imported as private bookmarks."
msgstr "从支持将书签标记为公开或私有的服务（使用 <code>PRIVATE</code> 属性）导入书签时，启用此选项会将所有标记为非私有的书签导入为共享书签。否则，所有书签都将作为私有书签导入。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:355
msgid "Upload"
msgstr "上传"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:362
msgid "Export"
msgstr "导出"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:363
msgid "Export all bookmarks in Netscape HTML format."
msgstr "以 Netscape HTML 格式导出所有书签。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:366
msgid "Download (.html)"
msgstr "下载 (.html)"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:375
msgid "About"
msgstr "关于"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:379
msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:383
msgid "Links"
msgstr "链接"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:387
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:389
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "更新日志"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:4
msgid "Integrations - Linkding"
msgstr "集成 - Linkding"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:9
#: bookmarks/templates/shared/nav_menu.html:38
#: bookmarks/templates/shared/nav_menu.html:98
msgid "Integrations"
msgstr "集成"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:11
msgid "Browser Extension"
msgstr "浏览器扩展"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:13
msgid ""
"The browser extension allows you to quickly add new bookmarks without "
"leaving the page that you are on. The extension is available in the official "
"extension stores for:"
msgstr "浏览器扩展允许你在不离开当前页面的情况下快速添加新书签。该扩展在以下官方扩展商店中提供："

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:26
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The extension is <a href=\"%(extension_url)s\" target=\"_blank\">open "
"source</a> as well, which enables you to build and manually load it into any "
"browser that supports Chrome extensions."
msgstr "该扩展也是<a href=\"%(extension_url)s\" target=\"_blank\">开源的</a>，因此你可以构建它并手动加载到任何支持 Chrome 扩展的浏览器中。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:31
msgid "Bookmarklet"
msgstr "书签小工具"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:33
msgid ""
"The bookmarklet is an alternative, cross-browser way to quickly add new "
"bookmarks without opening the linkding application first. Here's how it "
"works:"
msgstr "书签小工具是一种替代的跨浏览器方式，无需先打开 linkding 应用即可快速添加新书签。使用方法如下："

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:37
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Choose your preferred method for detecting website titles and descriptions "
"below (<a href=\"%(help_url)s\" target=\"_blank\">Help</a>)"
msgstr "在下方选择你偏好的网站标题和描述检测方式（<a href=\"%(help_url)s\" target=\"_blank\">帮助</a>）"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:41
msgid "Drag the bookmarklet below into your browser's bookmark bar / toolbar"
msgstr "将下方的书签小工具拖到浏览器的书签栏/工具栏中"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:42
msgid "Open the website that you want to bookmark"
msgstr "打开你想收藏的网站"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:43
msgid "Click the bookmarklet in your browser's toolbar"
msgstr "点击浏览器工具栏中的书签小工具"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:44
msgid ""
"linkding opens in a new window or tab and allows you to add a bookmark for "
"the site"
msgstr "linkding 会在新窗口或新标签页中打开，并允许你为该网站添加书签"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:45
msgid ""
"After saving the bookmark, the linkding window closes, and you are back on "
"your website"
msgstr "保存书签后，linkding 窗口会关闭，你将回到原来的网站"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:50
msgid "Choose your preferred bookmarklet:"
msgstr "选择你偏好的书签小工具："

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:58
msgid "Detect title and description on the server"
msgstr "在服务器上检测标题和描述"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:66
msgid "Detect title and description in the browser"
msgstr "在浏览器中检测标题和描述"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:73
#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:78
#: bookmarks/templates/shared/nav_menu.html:6
#: bookmarks/templates/shared/nav_menu.html:58 bookmarks/views/manifest.py:58
msgid "Add bookmark"
msgstr "添加书签"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:107
msgid "REST API"
msgstr "REST API"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:112
msgid "Copy this token now, it will only be shown once:"
msgstr "请立即复制此令牌，它只会显示一次："

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:114
msgid "New token key"
msgstr "新令牌密钥"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:120
#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:169
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "复制"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:125
msgid ""
"API tokens can be used to authenticate 3rd-party applications against the "
"REST API. <strong>Please treat tokens as you would any other credential.</"
"strong> Any party with access to a token can access and manage all your "
"bookmarks."
msgstr "API 令牌可用于向 REST API 验证第三方应用。<strong>请像对待任何其他凭证一样对待令牌。</strong>任何拥有令牌访问权限的人都可以访问和管理你的所有书签。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:139
msgid "Created"
msgstr "创建时间"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:166
msgid "Create API token"
msgstr "创建 API 令牌"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:170
msgid "Copied!"
msgstr "已复制！"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:195
msgid "RSS Feeds"
msgstr "RSS 订阅"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:196
msgid "The following URLs provide RSS feeds for your bookmarks:"
msgstr "以下 URL 为你的书签提供 RSS 订阅："

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:199
msgid "All bookmarks"
msgstr "所有书签"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:202
msgid "Unread bookmarks"
msgstr "未读书签"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:205
#: bookmarks/templates/shared/nav_menu.html:82 bookmarks/views/contexts.py:285
msgid "Shared bookmarks"
msgstr "共享书签"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:208
msgid "Public shared bookmarks"
msgstr "公开共享书签"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:210
msgid ""
"The public shared feed does not contain an authentication token and can be "
"shared with other people. Only shows shared bookmarks from users who have "
"explicitly enabled public sharing."
msgstr "公开共享订阅不包含身份验证令牌，可以分享给其他人。仅显示已明确启用公开分享的用户的共享书签。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:213
msgid "Feed URLs support the following URL parameters:"
msgstr "订阅 URL 支持以下 URL 参数："

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:216
msgid ""
"A <code>limit</code> parameter for specifying the maximum number of "
"bookmarks to include in the feed. By default, only the latest 100 matching "
"bookmarks are included."
msgstr "<code>limit</code> 参数，用于指定订阅中包含的书签最大数量。默认情况下，仅包含最新的 100 个匹配书签。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:222
msgid ""
"A <code>q</code> URL parameter for specifying a search query. You can get an "
"example by doing a search in the bookmarks view and then copying the "
"parameter from the URL."
msgstr "<code>q</code> URL 参数，用于指定搜索查询。你可以在书签视图中执行搜索，然后从 URL 中复制该参数来获得示例。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:228
msgid ""
"An <code>unread</code> parameter for filtering for unread or read bookmarks. "
"Use <code>yes</code> for unread bookmarks and <code>no</code> for read "
"bookmarks."
msgstr "<code>unread</code> 参数，用于筛选未读或已读书签。未读书签使用 <code>yes</code>，已读书签使用 <code>no</code>。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:234
msgid ""
"A <code>shared</code> parameter for filtering for shared or unshared "
"bookmarks. Use <code>yes</code> for shared bookmarks and <code>no</code> for "
"unshared bookmarks."
msgstr "<code>shared</code> 参数，用于筛选已分享或未分享的书签。已分享书签使用 <code>yes</code>，未分享书签使用 <code>no</code>。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:240
msgid ""
"A <code>user</code> parameter for filtering bookmarks by user name. Only "
"applies to the shared bookmark feeds."
msgstr "<code>user</code> 参数，用于按用户名筛选书签。仅适用于共享书签订阅。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/integrations.html:247
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<strong>Please note that these URLs include an authentication token that "
"should be treated like any other credential.</strong> Any party with access "
"to these URLs can read all your bookmarks. If you think that a URL was "
"compromised you can delete the feed token for your user in the <a "
"target=\"_blank\" href=\"%(feed_token_admin_url)s\">admin panel</a>. After "
"deleting the feed token, new URLs will be generated when you reload this "
"settings page."
msgstr "<strong>请注意，这些 URL 包含身份验证令牌，应像对待任何其他凭证一样对待。</strong>任何拥有这些 URL 访问权限的人都可以读取你的所有书签。如果你认为某个 URL 已泄露，可以在<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"%(feed_token_admin_url)s\">管理面板</a>中删除你的用户的订阅令牌。删除订阅令牌后，重新加载此设置页面时会生成新的 URL。"

